OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLingering
OL,6,Fpatchy rain will clear eastwards this
OL,7,Fevening, leaving scattered showers
OL,8,Fovernight, mixed with some clearer
OL,9,Fspells. A milder night than the
OL,10,Fprevious night with winds easing by
OL,11,Fdawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FIsolated showers first thing
OL,14,FFriday morning, but dissipating under
OL,15,Fa ridge of high pressure. This leaves
OL,16,Fbrighter spells in the afternoon,
OL,17,Fespecially in the west. Temperatures
OL,18,Fwill be near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
