OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMore
OL,6,Fwet and windy weather returns on
OL,7,FSaturday, followed by another ridge of
OL,8,Fhigh pressure and drier weather on
OL,9,FSunday. Staying autumnal into next
OL,10,Fweek with further spells of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
